nal Owl\n\nPlease excuse my sudden message.\nMy name is Ushimitsu Moumou, and I am an individual Vtuber.\nI saw your illustration on X, and I was wondering if I could request you to create a key visual for me.\n\nI would like to use it for the following purposes.\nKey visual for the fixed post of X\n\nCharacter\nA young man who likes to drink and is a yokai named Gyukki.\nWears kimono and gloves\nHe has red demon horns, cow ears and a tail (the tip of the tail is gray in the material, but in reality it is pitch black)\n\nElements and composition\nFull-body portrait facing the front\nSimple background (e.g., all white)\nThe figure is holding a sake bottle in his left hand and a boar's mouth in his right.\nI would like to leave the specific pose to you.\n\n[Materials\nFixed post of current X\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ushimitsumomo/status/1715571145398010210\n\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/ushimitsumomo/status/1715571145398010210", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 1187515, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15a20023690938904adf2d6d329bf3e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d15a20023690938904adf2d6d329bf3e, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ae159d58268037c6079e882d569744d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb511fc0b9b6296f51d256dc43b53dc3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4076593d1e328a6344c9dd726d15748", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e4076593d1e328a6344c9dd726d15748, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=281d03466c4e5fabde983fcc56b81846 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9fc27285/uploads/origins/6f0a81b7-5d79-495a-84de-76e1acf12ea8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6607e13ed8680bbcc543a7a1afdf7aa1 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is 斯比, a Vtuber from Taiwan.\nI would like to ask you to illustrate my friend's Vtuber.\n\n▶️Summary of the setting\nIrroc-\n｜My body is a rabbit\n｜He is a puppeteer who has a contract with a dying butler.\n\n▶️ image reference\nIrroc-\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0NXqGZmtXnD6E2EXXZK7PrvcC9ToxIi\n\n▶️ Usage\nUse as thumbnails on YouTube\nIntroduction of the picture in the video streaming\nPosting on SNS such as Twitter\nUse for icons and headers\nIf possible, we would like to make and sell a small quantity of goods. (If this is not allowed, we would appreciate it if you could state so in a separate layer.)\n\n▶️ Size\n16:9 ratio (1280720 / 19201080)\n｜Composition is up to you!\n｜Feel free to change the clothing as you like!\n｜We would appreciate it if you could put the person and the background on separate layers.\n\nWe prefer to receive the image in png or psd format.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0NXqGZmtXnD6E2EXX