way you paint your illustrations.\nI would like to ask you to draw an illustration including the background if you don't mind.\n\nI am a crane demon.\nThe humanoid is a girl of about 15 years old.\nShe is a crane demon and a land god of the wisteria forest.\nI like human children. I like human children so much that I hide them from the gods if I like them.\nShe has wisteria-colored eyes and twilight-colored odd eyes.\nShe has long gray (silver) hair that reaches her waist and hips.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her in a horizontal 9:16 format.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw a human figure in the front and a demon figure in the back.\n\nWe would like to use the illustrations as icons, advertisements, thumbnails, etc. on Twitter, YouTube, etc.\nWe would appreciate it if you could enclose transparent backgrounds of the human figure and the demon figure, respectively.\n\nPlease feel free to draw the poses and backgrounds as you like.\nWe will provide the URL for the background and details, so please use it to get an idea of what you are looking for.\n\nWe are willing to add a commission fee to the drawing cost, as we expect the drawing cost to be high. We would really like you to draw it for us.\n\nWe understand that you are busy, but we would appreciate it very much.\n\nYuzuru Fujishiro\n\nhttps://lit.link/fujishiroyuduru", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 1229857, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46660c77fdb1ad3bfd12ef6481ff71ef", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46660c77fdb1ad3bfd12ef6481ff71ef, https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26c3ea806ddc7f40dd012979225c8778 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5ff1f180a301f6813dbaec965786f08 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3bda6cb7a749b8ab8af346aa52b2dd5a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3bda6cb7a749b8ab8af346aa52b2dd5a, https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=328ccef9ffd013663a8d019507a1027a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8044de51/uploads/origins/4972619c-b0b6-4813-9586-4d425005a051?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6231eb93ee7597d450f47d2b9f359286 3x"}, "body": "ノ夜梟様\n\nこんばんは。ノ夜梟様のイラストをいつもTwitterで楽しみにしている者です。ノ夜梟様のヘッダーを拝見した際、異形頭さんが素敵で、この度ご依頼をさせていただきました。\n\n【希望する子】\n赤い蕾の異形頭さんをお願いしてもよろしいでしょうか…。\n\n【イメージ】\n・赤い蕾の頭\n・葉やガクはあってもなくても大丈夫です\n・男性体\n・ワイシャツ\n・手袋\n・腕まくり\n・ハサミなどが入ったポーチ\n・エプロン\n\n【職業など】\n・花屋さん\n・呼び名は「店長さん」\n・丁寧な方\n\n【資料URL】\nこんな感じ、というイメージを描いてみました…。\n(skebに登録しているものとは別のアカウントに投稿したイラストになっています。すみません)\nhttps://twitter.com/nemutainezu001/status/1676941484808093697?t=ZBEIvJz9-hyvFJjxtw4D3w&s=19\n\n【要素・構図】\n・腕まくりして見えている肌から花が咲いている\nor\n・花束を両手で持っている\nどちらでも、ノ夜梟様が描きやすいポーズで描いて頂けましたら幸いです。\n\nご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願い申し上げます。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 473292, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17815b20d0addab8f29d15eed74f5676", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17815b20d0addab8f29d15eed74f5676, https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=719e514240ba9737ad957a3eee6d09ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b756cc59bbb71d35cf9d56eb3b4a7c1b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d7a655ade7968568b5f0b4a1c919194", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d7a655ade7968568b5f0b4a1c919194, https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4b463513148ec04b54470a92037b95f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/17825b97/uploads/origins/015a405c-bb37-4c6a-8bc6-55f5e1f7a875?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2172d6a0a9aeb3cd9cabb6817747458c 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nI have been reading your SNS. I love the way the folds of the male character's clothes flow and the shading.\nI especially like the atmosphere of this picture!\nhttps://twitter.com/noya_hu9ro/status/1664209839541854209\nI'd like to have one of your characters in my BL novel \"Rei-Adulteration\" if you don't mind.\n\nCharacter\nChakura Ren\nA 26-year-old young man\nA psychic with a Kansai accent and a penny-pinching attitude, he is the grandson of a worshipper and has been possessed by a haunting god (visualized as an earth-colored tentacled earthworm-derived land deity) for generations.\nBlack hair with silver mesh on both sides Neat looking, host-like suit\nSlightly fished eyes\nHeight: 177cm\nHis special skill is a straight right hand with a bead sack. He physically expels evil spirits with a single punch.\nA talkative impostor according to Riichi, who has a rotten relationship with him\nWears black prayer beads on his left hand\nYoung president of Chakura Spiritual Services (abbreviated TSS)\nA master of Kyudo (Japanese archery)\nA pragmatist, cynical, and cynical person\n\nAttributes as a selfish, dominant, and aggressive person, but can also be a passive aggressor depending on the person he is playing with.\n\nThe following is a basic illustration by another artist.\nhttps://estar.jp/novels/26029651/viewer?page=1\n\nDesired Atmosphere\nJapanese horror/fantasy, bizarre, yokai\nI really like the world of SNS, so I would be happy if you could give me a similar taste.\nPlease dress in Japanese style.\nArrangements are welcome.\nI will leave any questions or details to you.\n\nI would like to use the finished work as a cover, illustration, or advertisement for the following pages or for an online novel.\nYour name and Twitter account will be clearly indicated.\nhttps://novel18.syosetu.com/xs8324a/\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/novel/series/9772542", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 982135, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b623ed02ede688d135d062b7ffe58b7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b623ed02ede688d135d062b7ffe58b7, https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=38a5e4e5b37522ee9c97c876b8ed663a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0d97c97a04fa2fe18feed95e11afefa 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4102ae4498f93cdefa12acb2c0515d2c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4102ae4498f93cdefa12acb2c0515d2c, https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d564c63c6d7650c3822d6bb59782c465 2x, https://si.imgix.net/affaabbb/uploads/origins/4f00baa5-1a7d-48e0-b30c-649e210776ae?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05fe9ed0c940e4f9d424ab96073d7e8a 3x"}, "body": "Hello, my name is Mengyoshiyuki, and I am a private Vtuber.\nI love the darkness and saturation of your illustrations, so I was wondering if I could request your help!\n\nIntended use\nFor Vtuber activities\nI would like to use it for my Vtuber activities, thumbnails, videos, twitter, and other SNS.\n\nComposition\nI would like to ask you to use the Chinese costume shown in the URL as a reference for the outfit.\nIf you don't change the hairstyle, you can arrange the costume as you like.\nI would like the character to be nihilistic and cool, like the Chinese mafia.\nI love the coloring and atmosphere of the jigsaw previously drawn.\nI would appreciate it if you could deliver a PSD with the person and background separated, as I would like to use it for my Vtuber activities.\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/tsurayoshisachi/status/1570068581467197444?s=46&t=3EJ2UOnIKAd2MMyhDoorGw", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noya_hu9ro/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2552022, "client_id": 1229857, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/19f806bd/uploads/origins/53796e03-bd9c-4c36-85d7-d7a3b9af3a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5bcff0f10ab7e9d33488ca1b43670c8a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/19f806bd/uploads/origins/53796e03-bd9c-4c36-85d7-d7a3b9af3a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5bcff0f10ab7e9d33488ca1b43670c8a, https://si.imgix.net/19f806bd/uploads/origins/53796e03-bd9c-4c36-85d7-d7a3b9af3a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4cad3acce77b80be728068898ad56b9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/19f806bd/uploads/origins/53796e03-bd9c-4c36-85d7-d7a3b9af3a14?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6663d5163532139148218642ebccf9f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumb